# 1. Ignore everything in the root directory
*

# 2. But do not ignore the .gitignore file itself (highly recommended)
!.gitignore

# 3. Allowlist specific files in the root
!AGENTS.MD
!LICENSE
!README.md
!opencode.json

# 4. Allowlist specific directories
# Note: To look inside an ignored directory, you must un-ignore the directory itself AND its contents.
!docs/
!docs/**

!.opencode/
!.opencode/**

!.plans/
!.plans/**
